# Delete an item from a list, back out to MY LISTS, and that list's card reads the new done
# count and/or total, as applicable (R5). Groceries seeds Buy milk (done), Buy eggs (open),
# Bread (open) -> starts at "1/3 done"; ItemOrder sorts open rows (newest first) before done
# rows, so the topmost delete button belongs to Bread (open, not done).
launch
tap text "Groceries"
expect text "Bread"
tap id "list.deleteItemButton" 1
tap id "confirm.deleteButton"
expect no text "Bread"
back
expect text "1/2 done"
